<b>Hakusan Shrine</b>

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:17.370
Thank you for your efforts, Kukuri-sama.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.370
Kokuyou!

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:21.660
I've brought you a kettle 
with something to drink.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:24.490
Seriously?! Lemme drink some of...

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:25.790
Eh?

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:27.930
Kukuri-sama!

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:32.760
I had no idea that happened!

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.550
I suspected something was amiss.

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.930
Tickle Punishment

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.930
Tickle Punishment

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:36.930
So I tickled her until she confessed.

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:38.590
So what do we do?

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:40.150
We remain calm.

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:43.850
Keeping abreast of the town's malison 
levels is one of Kukuri's duties.

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:46.730
And if you focus on your 
malison cleansing duties,

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:48.890
it will take some of that burden off her.

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:52.670
Set...

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:01.330
Hey, Mizushima.

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:03.290
Mizushima!

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:07.830
What's up with you? 
Your time improved again!

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:11.220
Where've you been 
keeping all this speed?

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:14.030
Th-Thank you.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.590
Mizushima Mitsuri

00:01:14.030 --> 00:01:16.620
Aw, come on, aren't you happy about it?

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:17.490
Hey!

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:21.970
Manaka Mana

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:21.970
You can't single Mittsun out like that!

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:25.250
Regardless, you did great, Mittsun!

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:27.730
Looks like you've got me beat 
at the 100-meter now.

00:01:28.430 --> 00:01:29.980
Thanks, Manana!

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:33.180
<i>You've always been my goal.</i>

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:37.210
<i>You help keep me motivated!</i>

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:48.330
<b>Tsukumo-possession.</b>

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:52.590
<b>A state in which a tsukumogami 
takes control of its wielder.</b>

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:56.010
<b>Can result in a temporary 
burst of incredible power.</b>

