<b>Chapter 3</b>

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:30.480
<b>Shirou-kun's Big Day!</b>

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:30.270
"Shirou-kun's Big Day!"

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.730
Troubleshooters'
Office

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:34.730
Now, then...

00:03:35.330 --> 00:03:37.830
We'll have to sort through 
everyone's concerns

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:40.630
to see if we can find any 
signs of aberration trouble.

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:44.490
"My mother says I can't 
have any dirty books."

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:47.660
Breaking that taboo by enjoying 
them in secret is half of the fun.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.870
"I have trouble with probabilities 
and simultaneous equations​."

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.000
Always review what you've learned, 
and do practice drills!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.750
"My best friend is better than 
me at everything, and it's hard."

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:58.250
None but you can determine your own worth!

00:03:58.670 --> 00:03:59.890
Anything else?

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:02.880
I'm seeing a lot of 
Shiramine-related submissions.

00:04:03.190 --> 00:04:05.360
"He won't take no for an answer." 
"He's a pain."

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:07.530
"He tries to flirt with 
anyone remotely feminine."

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:09.730
Whoa, whoa, talk about rude!

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:11.270
I'm not hitting on just anybody!

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:15.440
I only go after the ones with big boobs.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:18.820
You lascivious, lewd lecher!

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:21.780
The majority of our requests 
seem to be about you!

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:23.980
Justice is served.

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:26.370
For pity's sake...

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:31.290
6

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:31.290
Romance advice:

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:31.290
2

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:31.290
Shiramine Shirou:

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:31.290
Advertisements:

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:31.290
1

