00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:31.290
1

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:31.290
Schoolwork trouble:

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.990
Doesn't seem like there's 
anything supernatural afoot.

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:31.290
We'll leave it at that, then.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:34.250
Oh, crap! I've got places to be!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:37.340
I sent Manaka Mana-san from the track team

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:40.000
a love letter and asked her 
to meet me on the roof!

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.550
Another girl?

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:45.310
She's pretty, and busty, 
and friendly, and busty,

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:47.010
Shirou-kun...

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:47.460
and a great runner, and seriously busty!

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:49.930
She's my whole world right now!

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:50.970
See ya!

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.940
Would it kill you to learn?!

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:00.140
My beloved Manaka-san...

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:02.570
Today, I'm finally gonna get a girlfriend!

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:04.570
Sorry, were you waiting long?

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:09.070
Huh?

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:13.620
Y-You're the one who sent me this, right?

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:18.150
There was no sender on it, so I 
thought it might be a prank...

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:19.480
<b>Class Roster</b>

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:19.480
<b>Ayukawa Akina</b>

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:19.480
<b>Andou Akihiko</b>

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:19.480
<b>Ishikawa Ichirou</b>

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:21.910
<i>According to my database of 
girls who attend Kamioka East...</i>

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:22.500
<b>Hashimoto Michio</b>

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:22.500
<b>Manaka Mana</b>

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:22.500
<b>Mishima Mitsuo</b>

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:23.840
<b>Mizushima Mitsuri</b>

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:23.840
<i>This girl is Mizushima Mitsuri!</i>

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:26.340
<i>Her number on the roster is 22!</i>

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.100
Manaka Mana

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.100
Mizushima Mitsuri

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:35.290
S-So are you serious about this letter?

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:38.410
About liking me and... 
wanting to go out with me?

00:05:38.860 --> 00:05:42.110
Even though Manana... 
There's a girl in my class, Manaka-san,

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:44.530
who's prettier and has 
a great personality...

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:48.460
Compared to her, I'm just a pebble...

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:50.640
Th-That's not true at all!

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:54.850
In terms of cuteness, I'd say you're 
possibly even better than Manaka-san.

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:57.890
A-Anyway, about the letter...

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:58.340
<i>Cute?</i>

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:02.130
I-It turns out I, uh, I actually 
didn't realize that was your...

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:02.130
<i>H-He thinks I'm cuter than Manana?</i>

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:04.000
You listening?

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.510
Huh? Ah... O-Okay!

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:10.010
I'd be glad to go out with 
you, if you'll have me!

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:12.450
Bye!

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:13.760
Wha?!

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:18.500
What now?

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:21.020
Mizushima Household

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:21.020
Mizushima Household

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:26.210
Amazing... This is amazing, Mitsu!

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:28.230
I managed to beat Manana 
at the 100-meter dash,

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:31.550
and now a guy said that 
I'm cuter than her!

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:33.790
<i>I'm winning?</i>

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:36.060
<i>I've got her beat!</i>

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:39.090
I'm finally better at 
something than Manana!

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:42.630
The Next Day

00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:42.630
The Next Day

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:45.380
Wh-What the hell?!

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:47.790
Impossible!

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:49.630
The guy who misses every shot he takes...

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:53.260
Shiramine Shirou has a girlfriend now?!

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:59.030
Uh, Mizushima-san, maybe we 
should be less obvious...

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:00.810
Call me Mitsuri.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:02.590
We <i>are</i> going out now.

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:07.280
To think any girl would want to date Shirou...

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:10.940
Wasn't he supposed to be 
confessing to a different girl?

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:12.560
He's incorrigible!

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:17.310
I need to ask for detailed reports on his 
first date, first kiss, and first experience.

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:20.470
Shiramine-kun is totally 
going to cheat on her.

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:22.290
Mizushima's in for a bad time.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:26.800
Manana!

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:29.050
You should break up right now.

00:07:32.270 --> 00:07:35.340
I-It's none of your business, Manana!

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:37.020
He's my boyfriend.

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:39.580
It is my business! I'm your friend, aren't I?

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:43.150
This guy tries to get with 
every girl he lays eyes on.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:44.370
You shouldn't do this.

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:46.090
That's not true!

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:49.390
Shirou-kun wrote about how 
he liked me in a letter!

00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:51.200
He said I'm cute!

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:54.230
I'm trying to tell you that 
he says that to <i>every</i> girl!

00:07:54.230 --> 00:07:55.200
Open your eyes!

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:58.380
I'm worried about you, Mittsun.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:00.650
Y-You say that...

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:04.910
but you're just jealous that 
I got a boyfriend before you!

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:10.340
That has to be it! Because you've 
always looked down on me!

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:11.830
You're just jealous!

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:14.100
Mittsun...

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:16.880
Fine, then!

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:18.260
Do what you want.

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:29.480
Hey, I made some cookies for you.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:31.500
O-Okay...

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:33.940
Are they good?

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:36.730
Listen...

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:38.370
Thank you, Shirou-kun.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:45.120
See, I've always looked up to Manana.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:49.000
She's cute... and pretty... and tall...

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:52.610
She's a fast runner... and she's smart.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:54.130
Even her personality is great.

00:08:54.890 --> 00:09:01.140
But I finally outdid her! 
I beat her best time.

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:06.790
And not just that, but you said I was cuter!

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:10.450
So I'm really happy right now.

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:13.400
I...

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:16.580
I've put myself out there to a lot of girls.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.690
Basically every one that was my type.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.630
I realize it's given me a bad reputation,

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:23.910
and it's part of the reason 
I'm not very popular...

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:27.510
But I don't let it bother me. 
I don't get nervous because of it.

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:31.330
Because I still like who I am.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:36.020
But you've been measuring 
yourself against someone else.

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:40.930
You might be happy right now, 
but that'll only be temporary.

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:43.930
You need to decide what 
you're worth for yourself.

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:47.340
And...

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:50.050
That love letter...

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.900
I meant to put it in 
Manaka-san's shoe box.

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:56.530
I'm sorry.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:01.200
How could you?

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.490
I finally...

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.710
I finally beat her...

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:10.330
You liar! You said I was cute!

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:13.710
H-Hang on a sec! 
I wasn't lying about that—

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:13.710
Liar, liar, liar!

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:27.420
<i>That's the thing that goes 
off around aberrations...</i>

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:31.590
<i>Is there an amasogi in her bag?!</i>

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:36.990
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:36.990
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:36.380
<i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>!

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:41.490
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:41.490
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:41.490
<i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:47.500
Mizushima-san.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:52.380
Have you come across anything 
with strange powers that

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:54.150
you've been using lately?

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:55.870
Strange?

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:59.650
N-No! I haven't.

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:01.980
That's a weird question, Shirou-kun.

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:05.510
So you have...

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:09.270
Whatever it is, it's probably 
an amasogi, and it's dangerous.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:12.770
You really need to destroy it 
before something bad happens.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:17.530
Besides, anything you get from it 
isn't going to be worth the trouble.

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:19.740
It'll be an illusion, and a temporary one at that.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.840
N-No...

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:24.480
You're wrong! You have to be!

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:26.910
I finally found something to be proud of!

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:28.700
It can't be an illusion!

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.130
Mizushima-san!

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:32.670
Troubleshooters'
Office

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:32.670
Say what?!

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:35.180
The girl has an amasogi?

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:37.560
Y-Yeah...

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:40.790
"My best friend is better than 
me at everything, and it's hard."

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:44.180
One of the notes we received 
was from Mizushima-san.

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:49.450
Where's she gone, then? 
And what was the amasogi?

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:53.260
Well, she ran off before I could check...

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:56.690
We need to find her as soon as possible!

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.940
I-Is this really that bad?

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:00.820
It's worse!

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:05.820
The amasogi that Nanako 
created nearly killed her...

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:07.440
This girl has lost

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:11.790
the long-desired sense of affirmation 
that the amasogi gave her.

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:14.460
I hope she won't get 
any weird ideas, but...

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:16.740
We'd better stop her, fast!

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:18.900
<b>Manaka</b>

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:21.840
Wait!

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:24.600
You actually showed up.

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:26.340
Please snap out of it,

00:12:26.940 --> 00:12:28.970
Mizushima Mitsuri-san!

00:12:29.300 --> 00:12:33.730
You were so distraught at your best friend, 
Manaka Mana-san, always outdoing you...

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:37.360
And thanks to the amasogi, 
you were finally able to beat her.

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:42.360
But when Shirou found out the truth,

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:45.740
you were so frightened of losing 
the sense of triumph it gave you

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:48.740
that you came here to kill Manaka-san!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.000
Me, kill Manana?

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:57.820
What the heck?!

00:12:58.490 --> 00:13:01.760
I could never do that. 
She's my best friend.

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:03.760
Huh?

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:07.640
You're completely off the mark! 
Some detective you are!

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:11.020
You're the one who said 
she'd get a weird idea!

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:14.590
Hey! Why are you all making 
a fuss outside my house?

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.920
Manana!

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:19.650
Did you need something? 
It's kind of late.

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:24.400
Well... I wanted to return these to you.

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:30.030
Shoes?

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:35.540
I was really happy when 
you gave me these shoes.

00:13:36.050 --> 00:13:39.210
So I practiced every day with them on.

00:13:39.940 --> 00:13:44.230
But that was when my times 
stopped improving...

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:47.680
And I figured I just didn't
have any potential.

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:49.430
But then,

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:54.680
the shoes got caught on a corner and 
tore, so I had my mom fix them.

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:58.320
In the meantime, I bought and 
wore another pair just like them,

00:13:58.320 --> 00:14:01.030
so you wouldn't notice.

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:04.170
And then I suddenly felt a lot lighter.

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:06.410
My times started improving drastically.

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:14.950
That was when Shirou-kun told me about 
these strange tools called amasogi.

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:19.460
My new times were because of an amasogi...

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:23.850
I thought that was the case... but I was wrong.

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:28.970
The replacement shoes 
weren't the ones in my bag.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:32.100
It was the shoes you gave me, Manana!

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:37.340
I didn't suddenly get faster! 
I was being slowed down before!

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:39.230
Why...

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:42.110
Why did you do this to me?!

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:47.740
Do you remember when we first met?

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:50.750
I was short, and totally ordinary.

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:53.220
You were the center of attention...

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:59.500
I looked up to you... No, I loved you.

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:04.520
That's why I tried to get 
good at sprints, like you...

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:07.080
and started acting more cheerful, like you.

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:09.260
I even did my hair the same way.

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:13.330
And then you became my friend!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:16.510
One day, you started to say I was your goal.

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:19.210
I thought, if I could get out in front of you,

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:22.210
maybe you'd start to like me in the same way...

00:15:22.780 --> 00:15:26.520
So I had to always be better than you.

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:28.280
But then...

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:31.280
You gradually began to catch up to me.

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:35.280
I knew I wouldn't be able to 
stay as your goal for long...

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:41.270
And that was when I found those shoes.

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:46.460
It's true. Your times weren't 
improving because of these shoes...

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:48.420
Because of me.

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:53.100
And now it's all over... 
You'll never fall in love with me now.

00:15:53.710 --> 00:15:56.670
You probably even hate me.

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:57.560
Manana...

00:15:58.310 --> 00:15:59.850
You'll never be mine.

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:02.940
And if you won't be mine...

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:09.320
That was too close!

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.450
Stay out of this.

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:16.140
Well, this one's certainly out for blood!

00:16:16.140 --> 00:16:17.860
Grab the girl and let's escape!

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:19.950
Obi Wheels!

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:34.400
She's catching up!

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:36.600
We need to face her somewhere 
no one else will get involved!

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:37.600
Right!

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:43.360
Hey, what's going on?!

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:44.990
The explanation will have to wait.

00:16:44.990 --> 00:16:45.600
Incoming!

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:47.610
Shield Weave!

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:54.510
Pull back! The shield's not going to hold!

00:17:02.890 --> 00:17:06.120
We might've chosen our 
battleground poorly...

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:08.380
Kiriha-san, let's use Divine Possession!

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:11.380
No! That's our last resort!

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:13.340
Don't be so quick to rely on it!

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:21.080
Our defenses can't hold! 
Destroy the shoes!

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:23.180
But... the atonement!

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:24.810
That shouldn't be your 
concern right now!

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.650
Manana...

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:30.650
And if you won't be mine...

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:34.240
Archery Weave!

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.910
Manana!

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:45.820
Stay back!

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:01.790
M-Mittsun?

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:05.610
Why? Why did you give up so easily?!

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:08.190
Even if I got mad, you could still apologize!

00:18:08.590 --> 00:18:12.070
You could've worked hard so 
that I'd fall for you someday!

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:15.570
Why won't you be the Manana 
who's my best friend again?

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:23.500
I... was so terrible to you... 
I was betraying you this whole time...

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:27.960
But you're willing to forgive me?

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:32.340
Because I wouldn't be who 
I am now without you.

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:35.340
Mittsun...

00:18:35.810 --> 00:18:39.230
But just so you know, 
I don't like girls that way!

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:41.050
So don't get the wrong idea!

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:44.780
I wasn't sure how it was 
going to turn out, but...

00:18:44.780 --> 00:18:49.100
Now she just needs to destroy the shoes 
herself, and the matter will be settled.

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:50.730
I don't think so.

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:55.810
Mittsun...

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:58.110
Run.

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:03.740
Mi... Mittsun... You're my...

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:09.500
Woven Legs!

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:18.070
This is bad! She's even more powerful now!

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:19.880
Please...

00:19:20.270 --> 00:19:22.640
I can't control it...

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:25.290
I don't want to hurt Mittsun.

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:27.140
You have to kill me!

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:28.700
Manana!

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:31.140
Please, save her!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.570
Kiriha-san!

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:34.250
We've got no choice!

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:37.690
I'm not about to ignore the 
pleas of a pair of dear friends!

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:44.030
<b>Divine Possession</b>

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:44.030
<b>Divine Possession</b>

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:44.030
Divine Possession!

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:54.560
Power Obi: Hand Blade!

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:59.420
Shoes are counted together as one pair.

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:02.180
Destroy one, and sure enough...

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:10.020
Manana!

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:12.060
Mittsun?

00:20:14.750 --> 00:20:16.500
Manana!

00:20:20.350 --> 00:20:24.780
I never would've guessed Manaka-san 
was the one behind the amasogi.

00:20:27.060 --> 00:20:28.030
What is it?

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:33.790
Hello there.

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:36.040
M-Manaka-san...

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:40.320
Not long after I got home, 
I suddenly couldn't walk.

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:42.800
It took a while for me to calm down.

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:46.730
It's because I couldn't fix this 
without destroying the amasogi...

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:47.550
No.

00:20:48.090 --> 00:20:50.380
I'm just paying for the trouble I caused.

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:51.930
If anything, I'm grateful to you.

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:54.560
What happened with Mizushima-san?

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:57.690
She's right behind me!

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:05.950
I was surprised, too.

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:12.200
It looks like the amasogi was slowing down
more than just how fast I could run.

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:14.900
Thanks for loaning me a uniform, Manana.

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:17.460
Well, you can't wear 
your old one anymore!

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:19.450
Mizushima-san.

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:21.470
Shirou-kun?

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:24.840
Would you be willing to 
go out with me again?!

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:26.090
Sorry.

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:27.590
Augh!

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:29.660
Don't "Augh!" Shirou!

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:30.610
You never learn!

00:21:30.380 --> 00:21:32.260
He's certainly brave...

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:31.660
I sure don't!

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:32.730
Maybe you should!

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:34.250
Stop trying to spin this!

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:35.230
Goodness gracious...

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:36.970
Seriously, Shirou.

00:21:36.970 --> 00:21:38.650
Are you even listening?

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:43.420
<i>Still... the timing of how 
she lost control like that...</i>

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:44.980
<i>hardly seems like a coincidence.</i>

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:48.750
<i>What, exactly, is going on here?</i>

00:23:20.020 --> 00:23:32.970
<b>Next episode preview</b>

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:22.460
It's our daily life, 
but a little bit different...

00:23:22.460 --> 00:23:25.590
Because now I'm a girl, 
and Kiriha-san's a guy?!

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:28.010
What threat awaits us when we 
enter this gender-swapped world

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:30.110
to figure out what's going on?

00:23:30.110 --> 00:23:32.970
Next time on <i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>, 
Chapter 4: "Swapped!"

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:32.970
<b>Swapped!</b>

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:34.450
Don't miss it!

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Don't miss it!</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Illustration by: Minase Mayu</b>
